		{
			"id": "e52TKHSXVcRhVuilr",
			"description": "Snazzgun",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The snazzgun is the signature weapon of a Flash Git: a shoota rebuilt from looted, salvaged and traded-for parts of real quality by an Ork with more teef than sense, gaudily decorated and prized as much for status as for firepower. Codex: Orks background is explicit that Flash Gits' snazzguns are the best-made Ork small arms in general circulation, precisely because Flash Gits can afford to demand a Mek use good parts rather than whatever scrap is at hand.\n\nDesign: 10d pi+ (avg 35), matching the Kustom Shoota, since both are the improved- shoota tier; what a snazzgun adds is reliability and finish, not raw power. Exact dice distribution is identical: 79.5% through flak (DR 30), 0% against carapace or better. TL 7 as the Shoota family. Handling: 21 lb (lighter than the Kustom Shoota's 22 lb, since a snazzgun's quality comes from good components, not extra bulk); min ST 15 (raw formula sqrt(10x21)=14.5, essentially unmodified, since a well-balanced weapon needs no recoil bump); Rcl 4; Shots 24(4), a faster reload than the Kustom Shoota's 24(5). Acc 2 is the top of the framework's Ork bracket, for better sights than any other Ork gun. RoF 10 and Bulk -5 stay in the shoota class. Malf 15, the best reliability an Ork gun gets.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Orks"
			],
			"tech_level": "7",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "1000",
			"base_weight": "21 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
