		{
			"id": "eHHRAHQZhFG0hQ4LK",
			"description": "Kustom Mega-Slugga",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Meganob's sidearm: a slugga rebuilt to Meganob scale and Mekboy \"improvement,\" fired one-handed from inside a suit of mega armour alongside a power klaw. Background material treats it as simply a bigger, meaner slugga rather than a distinct weapon family, in keeping with how a Meganob's entire loadout is everything a Boy carries, scaled up and overbuilt.\n\nDesign: 10d pi+ (avg 35), the Kustom Shoota's damage tier in a pistol profile: kustom, one step over the plain gun, the same relationship the Snazzgun has to the Kustom Shoota. Exact dice distribution: 79.5% through flak, 0% against carapace or better. TL 7. Handling: 16 lb, heavier than the plain Slugga's 5 lb for the Meganob-scale frame (the same jump the Astartes- pattern bolt pistol takes over the human one); min ST 19 (raw formula sqrt(10x16)=12.6, bumped for the punishing recoil of a large cartridge on a pistol frame), well within a mega-armoured Meganob's servo-assisted strength, out of reach for a bare Boy. Shots 10(4); Rcl 4. RoF 3 and Bulk -4 are ordinary pistol figures. Malf 13, the kustom-job rating.",
