		{
			"id": "ec6ie_fHktHjXktuq",
			"description": "Zzap Gun",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A capacitor-and-lightning-rod contraption built by Meks who barely understand the archeotech-adjacent principles they're copying, the Zzap Gun charges up over a long, crackling moment before discharging a bolt Codex: Orks background credits with punching clean through tank armour and Terminator plate alike - when it doesn't simply detonate in the crew's faces first, a risk the same background treats as an accepted cost of owning one.\n\nDesign: No framework anchor covers this item by name. Built as the single hardest- hitting Ork energy weapon in this file: 6dx5(3) burn (avg 105, no \"ex\", since it is a single coherent bolt, not a bursting warhead) clears every personal armour on the table essentially always (100%/100%/100%/100%) and still beats a Terminator 96.4% of the time, a genuine Terminator-killer. Against vehicles it clears AV10-12 at or above 96% and remains a real threat at AV13 (72.1%), tailing off against AV14 (27.9%): it punches through tank armour, short of the guaranteed Land Raider kill a lascannon gives. Handling: 70 lb, a huge weapon built around a charge coil and accumulator; the raw ST formula gives sqrt(10x70)=26.5, but every depiction shows it braced on a mount or a Big Mek's reinforced frame, so it takes the M suffix at ST 20 as the Imperium Lascannon does. RoF 1 and a slow Shots 3(15): the accumulator needs a long charge-up between shots. Bulk -8 and Rcl 1 (an energy discharge, no propellant kick) fit a heavy support weapon. Acc 0: no Ork ever built decent sights for it. Malf 12 is set here, below the framework's Ork Malf 14 floor, to reflect the Zzap gun's reputation for killing its own crew, with a real misfire consequence rather than a mere jam. TL 10 as an Ork energy weapon. The WAAAGH! reliability bonus is the general Ork-tech rule in WAAAGH! Gestalt, not a special rule of this gun.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Xenos",
				"Orks"
			],
			"tech_level": "10",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "6000",
			"base_weight": "70 lb",
			"weapons": [
				{
					"id": "WG1jnTOO7BA-CN29F",
					"sv": 1,
					"damage": {
						"type": "burn",
