					"usage_notes": "Malf 12, the worst reliability rating this project assigns to any weapon (13 within a WAAAGH!, see WAAAGH! Gestalt). On a malfunction, the accumulated charge discharges backward through the gubbinz: the gun is destroyed and every Ork within 2 yards (including the gunner) takes 3d(5) burn ex.",
